  "content": "\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">簡介：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本模組為您的海洋增添了多種結構（地牢、神殿、遺跡、船隻），豐富您的探索體驗。這些結構內建了生物生成器與藏有戰利品的箱子，提供資源及與環境互動的機會。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋神殿四格結構</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋四格結構</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋警示神殿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋掠奪者遺跡</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋原版神殿遺跡</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋柱狀神殿</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">🌊 海洋籠牢</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">船隻由 Duder_123 建造，並經 JTL 重製／實作。</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⛵ 船隻：雙桅縱帆船</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⛵ 船隻：護衛艦（中型）&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">⛵ 船隻：護衛艦（大型）</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">支援的模組載入器：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">我們積極支援 Forge、NeoForge 與 Fabric 模組載入器，涵蓋從 1.16.5 到 Minecraft 最新版本。請瀏覽下方連結以選擇您偏好的載入器版本：</p>\n<div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/fabric-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jtorleon-studios-team/.github/refs/heads/main/assets/modloaders/neoforge-favicon-32x32.png\" width=\"60\"> <a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:5px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-edition-ocean-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge 版本在此 <span style=\"color:#f16436\">[點我🔗]</span></a></div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">必要模組：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">請務必安裝以下模組，它們是專案正常運作及提供完整體驗的必要條件。</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/library-ferret-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 📦 Library Ferret </a></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">連結：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">尋找我們的資源並加入社群：</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Link Tree </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fjtorleon-studios-team.github.io%252fdiscord.html\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Discord </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#e5e5e5\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;text-decoration:none;line-height:60px;margin-left:15px\" href=\"https://github.com/jtorleon-studios-team\" rel=\"nofollow\"> 🔗 Github </a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/197/bh_ad_see.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/189/bh_ad_cabe.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-the-end-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/190/bh_ad_end.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/awesome-dungeon-nether-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/458/192/bh_ad_nether.png\" width=\"2133\" height=\"408\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">合作夥伴：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">本專案獲 BisectHosting 鼎力贊助。歡迎查看他們的服務，以高品質與穩定性輕鬆託管您的專案。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fjtl\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/789de297-fbf1-423b-aa14-990433cf8f58.webp\" alt=\"banner bisechosting\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace;font-weight:bold\">行動呼籲：</h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-family:terminal,monaco,monospace\">有任何問題嗎？需要協助嗎？歡迎加入我們的 Discord 或前往 GitHub，與社群互動並貢獻一份心力！</p>",
